<title>SINGAPORE: UPP 1st-half net profit soars 231 pct.</title>
<headline>UPP 1st-half net profit soars 231 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  1.70  vs   0.51</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cents)	    1.47  vs   0.45</p>
<p>    Turnover				   33.02  vs  32.48</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)			0.97  vs   1.10</p>
<p>    Depreciation				2.98  vs   2.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			    1.63  vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.07  vs   0.28</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		  (loss) 0.22  vs   nil</p>
<p>Note - United Pulp and Paper Ltd makes and sells paper and paper products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
